  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Whole Wide World** (2 reviews): The transition was so smooth the singer claimed it was unplanned, astonishing the audience; The medley was the highlight of the tour, with an incredible audience reaction to its first occurrence [3][4]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Intro (We Belong Together)**: back after 38 archived shows (1059 days); rare: 14 archived performances [5]\n- **Destruction of the Kola Superdeep Borehole Tower**: rare: 7 archived performances [5]\n- **Rat Queen**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **Going to Kirby Sigston**: back after 286 archived shows (8519 days); rare: 3 archived performances [5]\n- **That Hippolytine Feeling**: back after 80 archived shows (1748 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **Until I Am Whole**: back after 57 archived shows (1360 days) [5]\n- **Against Pollution**: back after 59 archived shows (1362 days) [5]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Pez Dorado [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mountaingoats2021-08-08.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 22 songs; 100 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **tmg2021-08-08**: source not stated; 23 songs; 99 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [2]. Said about its sound: The listener expresses joy at hearing new recordings of the band again [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Mask compliance at the show was generally good, with a call for vaccination and masking [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mountaingoats2021-08-08.flac16**: taped by ezralite23; transferred by ezralite23; source: SP-TFB-2-13098P mics > Battery box > Zoom H4N [1]\n- **tmg2021-08-08**: taped by Liz Hamilton; transferred by Liz Hamilton [2]",
